{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ris1Z9YmQu1793746114.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國際能源署表示入冬在即，歐盟天然氣儲備不足。</p><p></p><p>國際能源署發表報告，指歐盟天然氣儲存設施的儲氣量處於2013年以來最低水平，或加劇冬季天然氣價格波動，並令國際市場價格受壓至2027年。</p><p></p><p>截至10月底，歐盟天然氣儲存設施的儲氣量約佔總容量七成半，低於歐盟設定八成的最低目標。意味歐盟面對市場供應波動的緩衝空間縮小，對液化天然氣的需求或進一步增加。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T00:00:32.253822+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T22:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T00:18:18.016749+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T23:58:24.043149+00:00","content_hash":"2814e188a16b346c309a07d9dd6a9707a22faca71e6af49ccc59f30b7a7efda1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-04T00:00:32.253822+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}